},{"characterId":"char_c42273","characterName":"ラプンツェル","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"64916","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"128761"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6644"],"vndbCharacterId":"c42273"},"originalCharacterName":"ラプンツェル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A mature girl. She has a modest, soft demeanor and a graceful, intelligent posture."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her profile is serene and calm, but also somewhat resigned, decadent, and desperate. Her gaze is clear and vacant, with the eros of a bud that had been forcibly made to bloom."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She never leaves her hospital room, but recognizes the people who visit her as her adoptive guardian, \"Grandmother Gothel\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her long hair always hangs from the window, but..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c42273"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"大人びた少女。慎ましい柔らかな物腰、知的で優雅な挙措。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その横顔は穏やかだがあまりに静謐で、どこか諦念的、退廃的、自棄的。まなざしは透明で虚ろ。無理矢理開花させられた蕾のようなエロスがある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分の病室から出ることはなく、訪れた人間を養い親である「ゴーテルおばあさま」として認識する。その長い髪を、常に窓から垂らしているが──"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6644","sourceWorkId":"21746","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"大人びた少女。 慎ましい柔らかな物腰、知的で優雅な挙措。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その横顔は穏やかだがあまりに静謐で、どこか諦念的、退廃的、自棄的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"まなざしは透明で虚ろ。 無理矢理開花させられた蕾のようなエロスがある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"王子様なんて来ないと言いながらも、今日もけだるく窓の外の景色を眺めている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"64916"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e4/e48db05e871676bf308707b2632bd347bed2b839cd84132b7aaf845a24694931.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ca/cacc904feb52b814c62a1f1502729e652675244af7b68b69b87495aee8b6e10d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"澤宮菜穂","creatorId":"vndb:s838","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s838","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s838","name":"澤宮 菜穂","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:128761:64916:6019:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c42274","characterName":"ゲルダ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"64917","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"128761"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6645"],"vndbCharacterId":"c42274"},"originalCharacterName":"ゲルダ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A courageous and firm individual. Her tone and behavior are not overly flighty, and she appears to be relatively sane."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is very skeptical of Paradise and its medical staff, but she sometimes states that she is \"not Gerda\", which suggests that her Fairytale Syndrome may be on the mend."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is haunted by a strong desire to find \"Kai\", a figure whose face she has forgotten."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c42274"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"勇気あるしっかり者。口調や行動は浮ついておらず、比較的正気に近いように見える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"この「楽園」や医療スタッフへの猜疑心が強いが、時折自らについて「ゲルダではない」と発言する辺り、「フェアリーテイル・シンドローム」は快方に向かっているのかもしれない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"顔も忘れてしまった「カイ」を探すという強い思いに囚われている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6645","sourceWorkId":"21746","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"勇気あるしっかり者。 意志が強く、こうと決めたら譲らない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"冷静な口調や筋の通った物言いから冷たいと誤解されがちだが、本当はあたたかな面倒見のいい性格で、行動は時により大胆。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"誰かを探し求めて長い長い旅をしていたはずだが、気がつけば、その誰か── “カイ” は、ゲルダの隣にいた。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"64917"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3a/3a0589e3b1f1721287a41a11d2930d647f5308a23f35504f8037fdb7925b654f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fb/fb0ed61c30226d092243d6b412a21c4f9861e3ab35ee89459d53df1c2deb8eb3.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"米島希","creatorId":"vndb:s281","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s281","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s281","name":"米島 希","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:128761:64917:8055:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c42275","characterName":"黒の少女","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["6647"],"vndbCharacterId":"c42275"},"originalCharacterName":"黒の少女","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl in black who occasionally appears in Paradise. She's a phantom-like being who shows up when least expected, but details such as her name, role, and objective are completely unknown."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c42275"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「楽園」内において時折目撃される黒衣の少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"神出鬼没の幻のような存在で、名前や立場、目的など一切が不明。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6647","sourceWorkId":"21746","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0a/0a513bbb890adff44d0b315c91a05b7b9b502791b289059dea32b20e5143b77b.webp","fallbackUrl"